# Session-local hand-off artifacts (session-closer). Never staged, never
# force-added. NOTE: docs/ is deliberately NOT listed — here docs/ is committed
# project content (docs/adr/ holds the decision records), so ignoring it would
# hide a new ADR from `git status`. ai-docs/ is the Claude-generated counterpart.
ai-docs/
